  "description": "Best-of-breed, tokenizer-agnostic text chunking for RAG and embedding pipelines. Async streaming API, word-boundary chunks with verified token counts and exact source offsets, a recursive splitter plus fixed/sentence/paragraph/regex/list/table strategies, and pluggable cl100k, o200k, and runtime-accurate BERT WordPiece tokenizers with per-model budget resolution.",
